What is Licorice Candy?
Licorice candy is a distinctive confectionery product flavored with extract from the root of the Glycyrrhiza glabra plant. Available in forms ranging from classic twists and ropes to modern chocolate-coated varieties, it offers a unique sweet-salty taste profile. While traditional black licorice remains iconic in European markets, North American consumers show stronger preference for fruit-flavored red varieties. The contemporary market now includes sugar-free, organic, and functional formulations catering to health-conscious buyers.
